# Akasha official publisher public key (base64 Ed25519) — the embedded trust root.
#
# Provisioned 2026-08-20. The daemon auto-trusts the shipped bundle by verifying
# each template's detached signature against this key, so a user does not have to
# approve every provider by hand. See docs/PLUGIN_FORMAT.md.
#
# Re-signing is required whenever a bundled template changes:
#   scripts/sign-bundle.sh <official-private-key-file>
# then commit the regenerated *.yaml.sig files. Skipping that step revokes the
# bundle's trust at use time, mid-workflow, on every upgrade.
#
# This key is compiled in (//go:embed), so it cannot be rotated for binaries that
# are already published — a replacement reaches users only through a new release.
LH6ljTYuavA8naqFyF7MsL2E8t/hSriLJ4HT3VIQbRM=
